 "build": {
  "id": "ee5b5860-e94d-4a77-b5f0-0b81fdda8ffc",
  "title": "Heretic Cultist - Mythic build",
  "description": "[talents]\nDark infusion didn't feel good in my opinion, also very cost inefficien. Dark veil only to be used as a last resort.\n\n[rotation]\nAlways keep 2x black blood up\nDepending on mana regen of party blanket the group in void shields, split mind makes you apply 2\nAlways keep up Void Shield on tank\nKeep up Sermon of Dread\nTentacle at 75+ sanity\nTry to time Entropic slam/ Blade of the Empire with tank dmg intake since it's your biggest spot heals\nForbidden ritual few seconds before aoe damage.\nGaze of C'thun as big instant (Due to Void-Touched) group heal.\nHallucination and Isolate to drop threat while following the tank during pull, can also Isolate a dps to save them.\nAbyssal Ward and Embrace the void as personals.\nEM doesn't heal for that much, use it maybe if you need an extra spot heal on a dps or dont have anything else.\n\nKeep mana between 20 - 60\n\nHaste Presence\n\nHand of Yogg could be a possibility later but haven't felt the need to use it because I already feel quite gcd starved.\n\nDps rotation: Slam Blade Slam Blade Slam Blade Blade Slam\n\n[stats]\nCrit > SP > STR > haste with enough INT to feel comfortable not having to sanity tap every 3 gcd's. You want a healthy balance between crit and sp.\n\n[gear]\nBest case scenario would be plate, STR/INT/STAM, crit/sp.\n\n[leveling]\nprio int/sp early, slow 2h. Run right behind the tank unless he's pulling back.",
